{"3803410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "团战小怪兽", "steam_appid": 3803410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual co-op action game where players create or join rooms in the lobby to team up and challenge bosses together. Each boss features distinctive attack phases and mechanics that require players to dodge, cooperate, and find the right timing to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute, chibi-style art direction and a character customization system. After defeating bosses, players have a chance to earn costume rewards to personalize their characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is a solo indie project, development is still ongoing — thank you for your patience and support!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual co-op action game where players create or join rooms in the lobby to team up and challenge bosses together. Each boss features distinctive attack phases and mechanics that require players to dodge, cooperate, and find the right timing to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute, chibi-style art direction and a character customization system. After defeating bosses, players have a chance to earn costume rewards to personalize their characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As this is a solo indie project, development is still ongoing — thank you for your patience and support!</p>", "short_description": "This is a multiplayer online co-op boss battle game. Players can team up with friends to enter dungeons and fight powerful bosses with unique attack patterns. The gameplay is light and fun, focusing on teamwork and coordination.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803410/9f26ddcca8358a56d33bd0fcca8bc4ab3ce800dd/header.jpg?t=1774